适用范围 / Scope
----------------

本许可证适用于主题自身的文件：模板、布局、片段、组件定义、页面清单、主题设置、脚本、样式，以及演示数据中的文字。
以下两类文件不在本许可证范围内，各按其自身条款使用：

- `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` 所列的第三方组件，按各自的许可证授权。
- `SEED-MEDIA.md` 所列的图片、视频与文档，是 UJCMS 项目制作的演示占位素材，仅限在本主题及基于本主题建设的站点内使用，
  站点上线前应替换为自有素材；不授予在主题之外单独使用的权利。

This licence covers the theme's own files: templates, layout, snippets, shape definitions, page manifests, theme
settings, scripts, styles and the text of the demo seed. Two kinds of files are outside it and stay under their own terms:

- Third-party components listed in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` keep their own licences.
- Pictures, video and documents listed in `SEED-MEDIA.md` are demonstration placeholders made by the UJCMS project.
  They may be used only inside this theme and sites built from it and are meant to be replaced before a site goes
  live; no right to use them separately is granted.


